<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Thalassini Avra - 110,000 tonnes coal Hampton Roads/Rotterdam $5.60 fio 35,000 shinc/40,000 shinc mid July GKE.</p>
<p>Humber - 70,000 tonnes coal Norfolk/Ghent $6.85 fio six days shinc end June Sidmar.</p>
<p>Transworld - 65,000 tonnes coal Dalrymple/Immingham $11.25 fio 25/6-5/7 British Steel.</p>
<p>ORE - Theodore A - 110,000 tonnes ore Tubarao/W.Dunkirk $6.25 fio six days shinc 15-30/7 Cobam.</p>
</text>
